@api = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### Magic link — request (always 200; in Development the link is logged to the console)
POST {{api}}/auth/magic-link/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testinjo@gmail.com",
  "language": "hr"
}

### Magic link — consume (paste the token from the emailed/logged link)
POST {{api}}/auth/magic-link/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LINK"
}
